1
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:04,060
-Hey, guys. -Hey.
-嗨！ -嗨！

2
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:06,030
-Hi. -Hey.
-嗨！ -嗨！

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,930
We need to talk about something.
啊，有點事和你們談談。

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:11,160
Yeah. We don't feel like we can host Thanksgiving this year.
我們覺得... 今年我們不能再作東感恩節晚餐了。

5
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:12,930
-What? -Are you kidding?
-什麼，什麼？ -什麼，你是在開玩笑吧

6
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:16,010
Well, it's just with work and the stress of adoption..
嗯，由於工作，還有領養孩子的壓力

7
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:18,040
we don't feel like we have the energy.
我們只是覺得沒有精力弄了。

8
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:22,580
Plus, we don't think it's fair that every year the burden falls on us.
而且，每年都讓我們受累，不公平。

9
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:26,050
That doesn't sound like you.
這不像你啊！

10
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,250
That's Monica talking.
這像是莫尼卡的話！

11
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:35,160
-No, we made this decision together. -She's putting words in your mouth.
-不，不，這是我們兩個人的決定！ -這一定是她的意思！  （英文直譯：莫尼卡把話語放在了錢德勒的嘴裡）

12
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:38,960
Don't you put words in people's mouths. You put turkey in people's mouths.
你不應該把話送到我們口中 而是把火雞送到我們口中……

13
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:43,590
I can't believe this. This is Emma's first Thanksgiving.
無法相信 這可是艾瑪的第一個感恩節！

14
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:47,970
-No, it's not. -It's not? When was she born?
-不是... -不是？她什麼時候出生的？

15
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:52,640
Well, personally, I think it's great you're giving yourself a break.
我個人認為，你們是應該休息一下子了。

16
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:55,480
-Thank you, Phoebe. -Sure. It's just as well.
-謝謝，菲比。 -不客氣, 這樣倒好

17
00:00:55,650 --> 00:00:59,480
I mean, last year wasn't very good. I think she's losing her touch.
還有，去年的晚餐真好啊 她已江郎才盡，今年不會更好了。

18
00:00:59,650 --> 00:01:03,950
-What? You are way off, lady. -Am I? Really? Am I?
-什麼？你搞錯了，女士！ -是麼？

19
00:01:04,130 --> 00:01:07,560
Well, why don't you cook Thanksgiving dinner and prove me wrong.
那你就再弄一次，證明我錯。

20
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:12,430
Well, think about it. You'd be trying to top what you did last year.
你想想 你是在試圖超過去年的頂峰

21
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:15,690
You'd be in competition with yourself.
你是在和...自己競爭！

22
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,870
That's my favorite kind.
真對我胃口！

23
00:01:19,370 --> 00:01:21,640
Okay, we are doing this.
好吧，今年，我們繼續！

24
00:01:21,810 --> 00:01:24,040
Don't let yourself get manipulated this way.
別讓自己這麼容易被左右。

25
00:01:24,210 --> 00:01:27,940
Stay out of this, Chandler. This is between me and me.
不關你的事，錢德 這是我和……「我」之間的事情！

26
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:33,280
We are supposed to make these decisions together.
我們應該一起決定啊！

27
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:36,250
Did you not watch the Dr. Phil I taped for you?
還記得費勒醫生說的麼？

00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:40,550
The One With The Late Thanksgiving

00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,550
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

28
00:02:30,010 --> 00:02:32,070
-Hey. -Hi. Happy Thanksgiving.
-嗨 -嗨，感恩節快樂！

29
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:34,580
Happy Meatless Turkey-Murder Day.
耶，火雞殉難日快樂！

30
00:02:35,850 --> 00:02:39,150
You guys, I ordered some chocolate pies from that bakery on Bleeker.
我訂了些巧克力派

31
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:42,120
-Could you pick them up for me? -You're not making the pies?
-你們能幫我去取過來麼？ -你不自己作派嗎？

32
00:02:42,290 --> 00:02:43,760
I don't make chocolate pies.
不，我不做巧克力派的。

33
00:02:43,930 --> 00:02:46,660
When I was younger, I entered this pie-eating contest.
我小時候參加過一個吃派比賽

34
00:02:46,830 --> 00:02:49,350
I ate so many that the thought of them makes me sick.
吃的太多了，導致我一想就噁心。

35
00:02:49,530 --> 00:02:51,230
Did you at least win the contest?
那你贏了沒有？

36
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:54,490
Two minutes, twelve pies and a part of one tin.
兩分鐘吃了12個外加一罐！

37
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:58,130
-Okay, I'll see you guys at 4. -Can't wait.
-好吧，我們4點見。 -很讓人期待哦！

38
00:02:58,310 --> 00:03:03,330
This dinner is gonna be so great. In your face, last-year me.
去年的莫妮卡, 我要你好看！

39
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:05,940
-Hey, Rach? -Yeah.
-嗨，瑞秋 -嗯？

40
00:03:06,110 --> 00:03:07,640
What's Emma doing today?
艾瑪今天有事麼？

41
00:03:07,820 --> 00:03:11,680
Well, let's see, I know that she has a meeting with her lawyer..
嗯，她啊，我只知道她今天要和律師見面

42
00:03:11,850 --> 00:03:15,480
and then she has to make a very big poop.
然後做一個重大的決定。

43
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:20,360
-Why? -I want to enter her in a baby pageant.
-怎麼了？ -嗯，我想讓她參加嬰兒選美。

44
00:03:20,530 --> 00:03:24,360
Oh, my God. That's the creepiest thing I've ever heard.
哦，天哪，這是我聽說過的最奇怪的事情。

45
00:03:24,530 --> 00:03:28,160
Okay, but before you say no, my friend Suzanne is entering her kid.
我朋友蘇珊帶她的孩子參加了

46
00:03:28,340 --> 00:03:30,600
And compared to Emma, she's a real dog.
和艾瑪比起來，那小傢伙就像只小狗！

47
00:03:31,370 --> 00:03:34,670
-Phoebe, all babies are beautiful. -Oh, okay.
-哦，菲比，所有孩子都是美麗的！ -好吧

48
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:39,140
No. Phoebe, just the idea of pitting one baby against another..
菲比，難道我們只是為了一個獎盃

49
00:03:39,310 --> 00:03:42,580
I mean, you know, and judging who's cuter just for a trophy..
就把孩子們比來比去，決定誰更漂亮麼？

50
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:46,650
-And a thousand dollars. -is something I'm very interested in.
-一千美金。 -對此我很感興趣！

51
00:03:47,890 --> 00:03:50,380
Oh, please, do not tell Ross.
對了，別告訴羅斯。

52
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:53,390
He still believes that what's on the inside is important.
他始終不信任那些內部的...

53
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:57,460
Okay. And Emma needs a cowgirl outfit for the competition.
對了，艾瑪得穿牛仔裝！

54
00:03:57,630 --> 00:04:00,360
Where am I gonna get a cowgirl outfit on Thanksgiving?
感恩節我上哪兒找牛仔裝啊？

55
00:04:00,540 --> 00:04:01,630
Well, I was thinking..
讓我想想……

56
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:05,030
Take the clothes off Joey's Cabbage Patch Kid!
把喬伊的菜地娃的衣服扒了！

57
00:04:14,220 --> 00:04:15,910
Did someone drop the baton again?
又有人把指揮棒給掉了？

58
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:19,540
Why come all the way from Kansas to do that?
為什麼每次都是堪薩斯的？

59
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:25,550
I don't get older, I just get better.
我不是越來越老，而是越來越好！

60
00:04:26,060 --> 00:04:27,820
You know what just occurred to me?
你知道我剛想到什麼？

61
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,560
This could be our last Thanksgiving just the two of us.
這可能是最後一次 只有我們兩個人一起過感恩節了。

62
00:04:30,730 --> 00:04:33,000
I mean, we could be getting a baby soon.
我覺得，我們很快就會有個孩子了！

63
00:04:33,170 --> 00:04:35,640
-You don't know that. -Somebody's gonna pick us.
-你怎麼知道？ -有人會選擇我們的。

64
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:38,470
But we haven't heard a thing from the adoption agency.
可是這幾周我們都沒收到領養消息！

65
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:40,670
I'm telling you, it's gonna happen.
我敢保證

66
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:45,110
Next year, it's gonna be you, me and little Hemingway Bing.
明年會是你、我、還有海明威--賓！

67
00:04:46,710 --> 00:04:49,770
-What? He's my favorite author. -Name one of his books.
-……嗯，因為他是我最喜歡的作家。 -說出他一本書的名字。

68
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,250
The Firm?
《企業》？

69
00:04:58,730 --> 00:05:02,320
Okay, let's see. Okay, the turkey's in the oven. The stuffing is ready.
好吧，火雞已經在烤箱裡了 填料也準備好了。

70
00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:06,520
You know, you always cook this meal all by yourself. Let me help this year.
你知道麼，你總是自己弄這些東西 今年讓我幫幫你吧。

71
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:08,330
Oh, Chandler, that's sweet.
哦，錢德，這太好了！

72
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:12,170
But you don't have to do everything Dr. Phil tells you to do.
但你不用一直按費爾醫生說的作

73
00:05:12,340 --> 00:05:17,780
I'm serious, let me do something. Just not the turkey. Nothing high-profile.
我是認真的。讓我做點什麼吧 不是火雞，也不是填餡，做點不難的東西。 .

74
00:05:17,950 --> 00:05:20,510
Okay, let's see. Oh, the cranberry sauce.
我想想……啊，酸梅醬！

75
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:23,670
It's easy to make, and no one really cares about it.
容易做，而且大家也不是很在意那東西！

76
00:05:24,550 --> 00:05:25,990
Tell me more.
說來聽聽？

77
00:05:26,150 --> 00:05:30,820
I'm gonna go check on something across the hall. You start by washing these.
我去對門兒檢查別的 你先把這個洗乾淨吧。

78
00:05:32,930 --> 00:05:35,160
Not with soap!
別用洗滌劑！！

79
00:05:38,300 --> 00:05:42,570
You obviously haven't tasted my Palmolive potatoes.
你肯定沒吃過我做的烤土豆……

80
00:05:44,010 --> 00:05:47,740
-Hi. Hey, guess what Joey has. -Three tickets to today's Rangers game!
-嘿，猜猜喬伊拿到了什麼？ -三張今天紐約游騎兵的票（美國冰球大聯盟NHL）！

81
00:05:47,910 --> 00:05:50,670
Dude, I wanted him to guess.
兄弟，我是讓他猜的！

82
00:05:50,850 --> 00:05:53,410
-Oh, my God. -Yeah, they're great seats too.
-哦，天哪！ -是啊，而且是好座位哦！

83
00:05:53,580 --> 00:05:56,450
-Guess where they are. -Center ice.
-猜猜什麼位置？ -正中間！

84
00:05:57,590 --> 00:05:59,550
Did I do something to you?
我是不是和你有什麼過節？

85
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,820
-The game's at 1. -So?
-嗯，比賽一點開始。 -怎樣？

86
00:06:03,990 --> 00:06:07,950
-Dinner's at 4. We'll never make it back. -So we'll leave before it's over.
-晚飯4點開始，我們趕不回來的。 -那我們就提前退場，這樣時間就夠了。

87
00:06:08,130 --> 00:06:10,790
But it could take us a long time to get back home.
你現在這麼說，可是到時候必定 要花很多時間回來的

88
00:06:10,970 --> 00:06:15,300
Plus, Joey could get lost and they could have to page us to go pick him up.
另外 喬伊可能會迷路，還得把他領回來。

89
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:18,740
Dude, two times that happened!
老兄，事不過三！

90
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:22,440
Look, Monica's been working hard all day.
莫尼卡為了做晚飯忙了一整天

91
00:06:22,610 --> 00:06:25,370
She didn't want to host in the first place. We shouldn't go.
她希望她的晚餐最重要，我們不該去的。

92
00:06:25,550 --> 00:06:26,980
He's right, man.
他說得沒錯兒

93
00:06:27,150 --> 00:06:30,120
-Yeah, I guess. So we'll see you at 4. -Okay.
-好吧。那麼四點鐘見。 -嗯

94
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:33,280
And get ready to taste my very special cranberries.
準備好品嚐我的特製酸梅醬哦！

95
00:06:33,450 --> 00:06:36,860
Or should I say "Chan-berries"?
或者，應該叫做「錢梅」...

96
00:06:40,530 --> 00:06:43,430
That's some gentle comedy, dude.
夥計，又不是在演輕喜劇

97
00:06:44,370 --> 00:06:47,430
-We're still going to the game, right? -Yeah.
-我們要去看比賽吧？ -是的！

98
00:06:52,270 --> 00:06:55,730
This is contestant number 16, Rebecca Hope from Yonkers.
這是16號運動員 來自楊克斯的Rebecca Hope

99
00:06:55,910 --> 00:06:58,040
-Hey. -Phoebe, listen, I think we gotta go.
-嘿！ -菲比，我想走了

100
00:06:58,210 --> 00:06:59,610
This place is freaking me out.
這地方讓我坐立不安。

101
00:06:59,780 --> 00:07:03,810
I've been watching this guy over there. I don't think he came with a kid.
你看到那邊那個人了麼 我可不認為他帶來的是個孩子！

102
00:07:03,990 --> 00:07:05,280
But we can't leave now.
但我們現在不能離開啊

103
00:07:05,450 --> 00:07:07,720
There was this one baby, Haley, who was favored to win..
最被看好的那個孩子Haley

104
00:07:07,890 --> 00:07:09,910
she got croup, so she had to stay home.
因為感冒不能來

105
00:07:10,090 --> 00:07:12,960
This competition just blew wide-open, folks.
競爭才剛剛開始哦！

106
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:15,760
Phoebe, it's just too weird.
菲比，這太奇怪了

107
00:07:15,930 --> 00:07:18,330
I just saw a 1-year-old with pantyhose on.
我看見一個一歲的小孩穿連褲襪！

108
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:21,490
Oh, I know. We should've been more prepared.
哦，我就覺得我們準備不夠充分

109
00:07:22,740 --> 00:07:26,940
It's okay. Now, the way I see it, our real competition now is Cameron.
我覺得，咱們最有力的競爭對手是卡米隆。

110
00:07:27,110 --> 00:07:28,970
My God, they just took her sweater off.
哦，天哪，她的衣服被脫掉了

111
00:07:29,140 --> 00:07:31,440
Look at those arms. Hello, Michelin Man.
看她的手臂，就像...米其林 （著名輪胎的卡通形象，綠色滴~~）

112
00:07:31,610 --> 00:07:35,380
Phoebe, come on. You know what, it's already 3:00.
菲比，已經三點鐘了 而他們還沒有評審到艾瑪這一組

113
00:07:35,550 --> 00:07:38,680
They haven't even gotten to Emma's group yet. We got dinner.
我們該走了，回去吃飯。

114
00:07:38,850 --> 00:07:41,850
But Emma's got what it takes. She could go all the way!
但艾瑪今天肯定能贏

115
00:07:43,930 --> 00:07:47,830
-Phoebe, you have to calm down. -Okay.
-菲比，冷靜點。 -好吧， 

116
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:53,560
Rachel, the hottest babies in the tri-state area are in this room right now.
瑞秋，現在 這附近最漂亮的寶貝們都在這裡了。

117
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:59,330
I overheard a judge say that not one of them holds a candle to Emma.
而我聽見一個評審說 沒人比得過艾瑪。

118
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:00,870
-Really? -Yeah.
-真的麼？ -沒錯！

119
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:03,700
-You heard him say that? -Yeah.
-你聽見他們這麼說？ -對。

120
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:07,970
All right. Okay. All right, let's give these babies something to cry about.
好吧，那就讓我們 給其他的孩子們一點悲慘的回憶！

121
00:08:08,150 --> 00:08:11,980
Good. Let's get down to business. Emma needs some makeup.
太好了，開工吧！艾瑪需要化妝。

122
00:08:12,150 --> 00:08:13,420
What?
什麼？

123
00:08:13,590 --> 00:08:15,820
She's gonna look washed-out next to the others.
她應該比其他孩子看起來更漂亮！

124
00:08:15,990 --> 00:08:18,420
No, I'm not letting you put makeup on my baby.
菲比，我不會讓你給我的孩子化妝的！

125
00:08:18,590 --> 00:08:20,820
-Why not? -Because I already did.
-為什麼不？ -因為我已經給她化過了！

126
00:08:27,870 --> 00:08:31,830
You suck! Get off the ice, you idiot!
鮑伯，幹掉那傢伙！

127
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:35,270
-What a game. -I know. Yeah.
-太精彩了！ -沒錯，耶！

128
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:38,670
-I can't believe Chandler's missing this. -I'm sorry he's not here.
-真遺憾錢德錯過了這場比賽！ -我也替他覺得遺憾

129
00:08:38,850 --> 00:08:42,980
But I gotta say, I am really enjoying nacho chair.
但我要說的是，我真的很喜歡這個「玉米片」座！

130
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:47,520
Yeah, I'd probably enjoy it more if you didn't keep batting my hand away.
嗯，要是你不總是把我的手打開， 我可能也會吃不少呢

131
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,920
-Yeah! -These seats are great.
-哦！ -這位置太棒了！

132
00:08:51,090 --> 00:08:54,080
I know, I know. When I was here for "Holidays on lce"..
是啊，沒錯！ 上次假期我在這看比賽，座位太遠了

133
00:08:55,800 --> 00:09:00,260
I was sitting so far away, Michelle Kwan couldn't read my banner.
關穎珊（花樣滑冰世界冠軍）根本就看不到我舉的條幅。

134
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:03,230
Dude, I'm sure she knows you heart her.
老兄, 我認為她知道你心裡有她

135
00:09:04,210 --> 00:09:06,470
I hope so.
希望吧

136
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:09,870
We'd better get going. If we don't leave now, we're gonna be late.
嘿，我們該走了啦，回去吃飯。

137
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:13,670
But it's a tie game. So we're a little late. The girls will be there.
可比賽太精彩了！ 我們可以晚回去點吧，女生們應該準時的

138
00:09:13,850 --> 00:09:15,910
Let's just stay for one more goal.
再進一個球再走啦

139
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,610
-I don't know. -One more fight.
-不好吧.. -再進攻一輪？

140
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:19,720
-Okay. -Okay.
-好吧。 -好吧。

141
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,660
Where is everybody? They're 45 minutes late.
大家都哪裡去了？他們遲到了45分鐘！

142
00:09:25,830 --> 00:09:30,890
I can't believe they're not here. I slave and I slave for what?
我不相信他們會不來！我辛苦了一天 而我這麼辛苦是為了什麼？

143
00:09:31,070 --> 00:09:34,470
They've ruined Cranberry Day.
他們毀了我的酸梅日！

144
00:09:35,470 --> 00:09:37,770
-How late are we? -Forty-five minutes.
-我們遲到了多久？ -45分鐘

145
00:09:37,940 --> 00:09:40,240
-Here. -Okay.
-給. -好的.

146
00:09:40,710 --> 00:09:44,270
Rachel and Phoebe are already there, so they probably started without us.
瑞秋和菲比應該已經到了 也就是說她們應該已經開始了

147
00:09:44,450 --> 00:09:47,680
We could just slip in, and no one needs to know where we were.
讓我們溜進去，這樣誰都不會注意我們的。

148
00:09:48,780 --> 00:09:52,950
-You may want to lose the foam finger. -Oh, no, no, no.
-你不把這個泡沫大手指扔掉麼？ -哦，才不呢！

149
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:55,750
You just want to put it on your hand.
我知道你想搶走他！

150
00:09:59,460 --> 00:10:02,760
-You're not at Thanksgiving? -No, we're late.
-你們沒在裡面？ -不，我們遲到了！

151
00:10:02,930 --> 00:10:05,160
-What are you doing here? -We're late too.
-你們在這裡幹什麼？ -我們也遲到了！

152
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:09,060
We figured we could be late because you'd be on time.
我們本以為你們不會遲到的！

153
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:12,330
Don't point that thing at me, Tribbiani.
別用這個指著我，崔比阿尼！

154
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:15,940
-Nobody's here? Monica's gonna kill us. -Yeah, where were you?
-那...裡面沒人，莫尼卡會殺了我們的！ -你們到什麼地方去了？

155
00:10:16,110 --> 00:10:18,510
-Well.. -Yeah, what's with the trophy?
-啊… -那是什麼獎盃？

156
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:22,170
Well, we were at a spelling bee.
嗯，我們去參加拼字大賽了。

157
00:10:23,450 --> 00:10:25,180
And I won.
我贏了！

158
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:29,910
You won an adult Thanksgiving Day spelling bee?
你在感恩節這天 贏得了一場成人拼字遊戲？

159
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:33,690
Yes. Y-E-S. Yes.
是-的, 是的！

160
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:39,270
Let me see this. "Grand Supreme Little Darling, New York Division"?
讓我看看…… 超級小可愛，紐約區。

161
00:10:39,430 --> 00:10:41,900
That's me.
那便是我！

162
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:46,500
You entered Emma in a beauty pageant?
你們讓艾瑪參加了選美比賽？

163
00:10:46,670 --> 00:10:50,700
And it looks like she put makeup on her.
而且還給她化了妝！

164
00:10:51,050 --> 00:10:55,040
Wait a second. Where have I seen that cowgirl outfit before?
等等，等等 我好像在什麼地方見過這身牛仔...

165
00:10:56,380 --> 00:10:58,610
I can't believe this. She's our daughter.
無法置信，她是我們的女兒！

166
00:10:58,790 --> 00:11:02,480
That you would treat her like some kind of show dog is inexcusable.
你把她當成觀賞狗一樣，不可饒恕

167
00:11:02,660 --> 00:11:06,680
-She won a thousand dollars. -So this is an annual thing?
-她為我們贏得了一千美元！ -啊，是一年一次的嗎……

168
00:11:10,330 --> 00:11:13,230
That's Alicia May Emory's outfit!
啊，這是Alicia Mae的裝備！

169
00:11:14,670 --> 00:11:17,730
Guys, there are people in there who are not getting any happier.
夥計們，有人在裡面要發火了！

170
00:11:17,910 --> 00:11:21,530
-What are we gonna do? -I gotta put Emma down for a nap.
-天哪，我們該怎麼辦？ -我不知道，你們想吧, 我先把艾瑪送回去。

171
00:11:21,710 --> 00:11:25,010
And, Rach, while you're in there, throw something on Alicia May.
哦，瑞秋，至少給個主意嗎

172
00:11:26,550 --> 00:11:30,710
-All right, what are we gonna say? -We'll say that we were mugged.
-我們該怎麼說？ -我們可以說，我們被搶劫了

173
00:11:30,890 --> 00:11:33,550
You can't get mad at someone who's been mugged.
當有人被搶了的時候，是不能生氣的！

174
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,920
Good. But you don't look like you were mugged.
嗯，不錯，但你看起來不像被搶過。

175
00:11:36,090 --> 00:11:38,350
No. Here.
不像..這樣才像

176
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,290
Hey!
嘿！

177
00:11:45,530 --> 00:11:47,760
Do you hear something?
你有沒有聽到什麼？

178
00:11:52,140 --> 00:11:56,010
-They're out there. -Let me see.
-他們都在外面！ -讓我看看！

179
00:11:56,880 --> 00:12:02,280
I can't believe this. They're an hour late, and they're just standing there talking.
我真沒辦法相信，他們遲到了一小時 還在那裡聊天！

180
00:12:02,450 --> 00:12:07,290
Everything's so distorted. It looks like Joey has a giant hand.
一切都亂套了，喬伊有只大手！

181
00:12:08,660 --> 00:12:11,780
That says "Rangers" on it. They went to the game.
上面寫「游騎兵」，他們去看比賽了！

182
00:12:12,290 --> 00:12:15,630
Oh, they are in for a world of pain.
哦，這太可怕了！

183
00:12:17,430 --> 00:12:21,700
-Ross' shirt is torn. -They're late and they're sloppy.
-羅斯的襯衫撕壞了。 -他們不但遲到，而且衣衫不整！

184
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:26,270
All right, Emma's napping. What happened to your shirt?
好了，艾瑪睡下了。你的襯衫怎麼了？

185
00:12:26,570 --> 00:12:30,310
I got mugged, and they stole my pocket.
我被搶了，他們還偷走了我的錢包。

186
00:12:31,610 --> 00:12:34,410
We're just trying to figure out an excuse.
瑞秋，我們是在找借口。

187
00:12:35,820 --> 00:12:36,810
How about this?
好吧，想想

188
00:12:36,980 --> 00:12:41,320
We could say that Monica told us 5:00, not 4:00. That way we're right on time.
我們可以說，莫尼卡告訴我們是5點 而不是4點，所以我們沒遲到，我們是準時的！

189
00:12:41,490 --> 00:12:47,860
Or we could plant PCP in the apartment and call the cops on her.
或者, 我們可以在房間裡放些迷藥，佈個局！

190
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:54,090
That would be a good way to get rid of all the PCP we have lying around.
嗯，這的確是個下迷藥的好辦法。

191
00:12:54,270 --> 00:12:56,260
We'll just say that she said it was 5:00.
你可以就說她說的是5點

192
00:12:56,440 --> 00:13:00,170
We'll just act casual. We're not late, we're right on time.
做得自然些 所以我們根本沒有遲到！

193
00:13:05,210 --> 00:13:08,200
"We know you're out there."
「我們知道你們在外面。」

194
00:13:10,850 --> 00:13:13,320
Who do you think it's from?
你覺得這是誰寫的？

195
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:19,020
Oh, God, this is bad. This is so bad.
哦，太糟了，太糟了。

196
00:13:19,190 --> 00:13:21,490
Well, let's just go in there and face them.
好吧，讓我們進去面對他們吧。

197
00:13:21,660 --> 00:13:26,860
I'm not going in first. I bet that vein on Monica's forehead is popping like crazy.
我不要先進去 莫尼卡生氣的面孔會讓我發瘋的。

198
00:13:27,030 --> 00:13:30,900
I hate that thing. It's like a bolt of lightning.
嗯，我也不要 那張臉就像扭曲的閃電一樣……

199
00:13:31,070 --> 00:13:35,100
Why don't we play Rock, Paper, Scissors, and whoever loses, goes in first.
嘿，我有主意了 我們可以玩石頭剪子布，輸了的先進去！

200
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:37,840
-All right, I'm in. -Ready.
-好吧，開始吧。 -準備好了麼？

201
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,310
I win.
啊，我贏了！

202
00:13:44,490 --> 00:13:48,110
-What is that? -That's fire. It beats everything.
-這是什麼？ -火焰，贏過一切！

203
00:13:48,290 --> 00:13:51,350
Oh, really? Does it beat water balloon?
真的麼？能贏過一個水球麼？

204
00:13:53,690 --> 00:13:56,750
Well-played, Phoebe Buffay. Well-played.
好極了，菲比，玩得真好。

205
00:13:56,930 --> 00:13:59,420
All right, let's all go in at the same time.
好啦好啦，讓我們一起進去算了。

206
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,760
-Okay. -Okay.
-好。 -好。

207
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:07,070
-It's locked. -What? Oh, sure, now they lock it.
-鎖住了！ -哈，他們把門鎖上了

208
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:09,400
When they're having sex on the couch, it's like:
等他們在躺椅上 準備嘿咻的時候，他們就會說

209
00:14:09,580 --> 00:14:12,880
"Come on in, my butt is surprisingly hairy!"
「啊，快進來，快進來，我等不了了！」

210
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:18,710
All right, come on. All right, you guys, we're so sorry we're late.
好吧。夥計們，你們怎麼樣啊？ 很抱歉我們遲到了

211
00:14:18,890 --> 00:14:21,410
Please let us in so we can have dinner together.
讓我們進去一起吃晚餐吧！

212
00:14:21,590 --> 00:14:26,150
No, everything's cold. The turkey's dried out and the stuffing's all soggy.
不，東西都涼了 火雞干了，餡也鬆了！

213
00:14:26,330 --> 00:14:29,160
Yeah, and there's a bowl of cranberry sauce that's..
嗯，而且那碗酸梅醬也……

214
00:14:29,330 --> 00:14:31,160
What happens to cranberry sauce?
酸梅醬怎麼了？

215
00:14:31,330 --> 00:14:34,500
-Nothing, it's fine. -Oh, thank God.
-沒事兒，很好。 -哦，謝天謝地。

216
00:14:34,670 --> 00:14:38,260
Come on, you guys, we're sorry. Our subway broke down.
好啦，夥計們 真的抱歉，我們的車壞了。

217
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:42,070
That's a lie! You went to the game. I can see Joey's hand.
說謊！你們去看比賽了 我能看到喬伊的手！

218
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:44,340
For the love of God, take it off!
我說過了讓你把它扔掉了！

219
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:50,710
Guys, it doesn't matter why we're late. We're all here now.
夥計們，我們是否遲到了並不重要 重要的是我們都到了

220
00:14:50,890 --> 00:14:53,880
Please let us in so we can have some of your delicious turkey.
讓我們進去吃美味的火雞吧！

221
00:14:56,860 --> 00:14:59,990
I had a dream once about a fax machine that did that.
我做夢都在想啊，這是什麼？

222
00:15:01,460 --> 00:15:03,590
That's all the turkey you're gonna get.
這就是你們該得的火雞！

223
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:07,700
-How are we gonna decide who gets this? -Water balloon!
-怎麼決定誰吃？ -水球！

224
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:14,930
What are we gonna do? I'm starving.
我們該怎麼辦啊，我餓死了！

225
00:15:15,110 --> 00:15:17,410
I just remembered, we do have something to eat.
哦，對了，我想起來了

226
00:15:17,580 --> 00:15:20,100
Monica put something in our oven this morning.
今天早晨莫尼卡放了點東西在爐子裡面！

227
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:22,610
You touch that, and you will be sorry!
嘿，動了它你會後悔的！

228
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:27,190
Guys, I'd listen to her. The vein is bigger than I've ever seen it!
大伙, 最好聽她的 她的血管漲到前所未有的大

229
00:15:30,820 --> 00:15:33,160
Oh, my God, it's Brussels sprouts!
天哪，是甘藍菜！

230
00:15:33,330 --> 00:15:35,760
That's worse than no food.
這是什麼嘛，不能吃的！

231
00:15:37,500 --> 00:15:40,520
All you got was Monica's stinky Brussels sprouts.
啊哈，你們喜歡莫尼卡的發臭的甘藍菜麼？

232
00:15:40,700 --> 00:15:41,900
Stinky?
發臭的？

233
00:15:42,070 --> 00:15:45,440
Please let me stay on this side of the door.
請讓我呆在這一邊……

234
00:15:45,610 --> 00:15:49,240
Oh, I know! I still have my old key.
對了，我還有以前的鑰匙呢。

235
00:15:49,410 --> 00:15:51,500
We can just unlock the door.
我們可以直接把門打開！

236
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:54,710
I don't know if that's a good idea. They don't wanna be with us.
我不覺得這是個好主意 他們明顯不想和我們在一起。

237
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:56,610
I don't wanna be with them either..
你知道麼，我也不想和他們一起

238
00:15:56,780 --> 00:16:00,310
but it's Thanksgiving, and we should not want to be together together.
但今天是感恩節，不想在一起也要在一起！

239
00:16:00,490 --> 00:16:03,320
If I could just get in there, make a face-to-face apology..
讓我們進去面對面的道歉吧

240
00:16:03,490 --> 00:16:06,150
look them in the eye, I could get them to forgive us.
看到我的眼睛，他們就會原諒我的。	

241
00:16:06,330 --> 00:16:09,060
-I don't know. -I'm telling you..
-我不懂。 -我來告訴你……

242
00:16:11,670 --> 00:16:14,660
I can do it.
我做得到。

243
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:17,170
Yeah, he can do it.
嗯，你做得到。

244
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:28,580
It all looks so beautiful.
啊，太美了！

245
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:32,450
-The turkey, the stuffing. -The cranberries.
-那火雞，那填料…… -那酸梅呢？

246
00:16:32,620 --> 00:16:35,780
Enough! A monkey could've made them.
夠了，猴子都會做！

247
00:16:41,030 --> 00:16:44,290
Hey, listen, guys, we feel really terrible.
嘿，聽我說，我們真得很抱歉……

248
00:16:44,730 --> 00:16:47,700
He's doing that weird eye-contact thing.
他又來那什麼「目光接觸」了

249
00:16:47,870 --> 00:16:50,300
Don't look at him. Don't look at him.
別看他，別看他。

250
00:16:50,470 --> 00:16:55,070
Come on, you guys. We want you to know we're very, very sorry.
聽我說，夥計們，我們想讓你們瞭解 我們真的，真的很抱歉……

251
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:58,370
Right, guys?
對吧，夥計們？

252
00:16:58,550 --> 00:17:01,610
-I feel terrible. -Oh, so sorry.
-真的很抱歉 -非常，對不起……

253
00:17:03,450 --> 00:17:06,080
But let's not ruin this day. You've worked so hard.
別讓我們毀了這一天，你們如此的辛勞！

254
00:17:06,250 --> 00:17:09,450
Let's move past this and try to have a nice meal all together, huh?
讓我們忘了這件事，一起吃飯吧！

255
00:17:09,620 --> 00:17:12,750
The floating heads do make a good point.
那些漂浮著的腦袋好像說的沒錯。

256
00:17:13,690 --> 00:17:15,590
Yeah, they do seem to feel pretty bad.
是啊，他們真的好像很抱歉。

257
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:18,320
-So bad. -So bad.
-對不起，對不起…… -對不起，對不起……

258
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:21,730
Okay.
好吧

259
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:26,530
Okay, you two go get the dessert, and I'll let you in.
好吧，你們兩個去拿甜品來 我讓你們進來。

260
00:17:27,140 --> 00:17:29,410
Dessert?
甜品？

261
00:17:29,580 --> 00:17:34,140
Yeah, I asked you and Phoebe to pick up the pies. You did remember, right?
是啊，我讓你和菲比去取派 你記得的，對吧？

262
00:17:34,310 --> 00:17:38,410
Pies. Oh, we thought you said "prize."
派？啊，我們以為是「獎」！ (註：英語中「派」和「獎」發音相同。）

263
00:17:39,620 --> 00:17:41,920
Here.
這個！

264
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:48,850
-"Grand Supreme Little Darling"? -Congratulations!
-超級小可愛？ -恭喜！

265
00:17:50,530 --> 00:17:54,190
Oh, my God, you forgot the pies? Well, I cannot believe this.
天哪，你忘了拿派？無法置信！

266
00:17:54,370 --> 00:17:56,960
You forced me to make dinner, you're an hour late..
你們強迫我做飯，又遲到一小時

267
00:17:57,140 --> 00:18:00,070
and you forget the one little thing that I asked you to do.
居然還忘記了我拜託你們做的一點點小事！

268
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:03,270
Really, girls, not cool.
真的，女孩子們真冷酷。

269
00:18:04,610 --> 00:18:08,210
Well, you man-heads aren't any better. You lied about going to the game.
好吧，你們男人又好到哪裡去？ 你們說謊，去看比賽

270
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:10,650
You knew it'd make you late, and you went anyway.
明知道會遲到，還堅持要去。

271
00:18:10,820 --> 00:18:13,790
Hey, I'm getting a little tired of this. We said we're sorry.
我有點煩了。我們都道歉了

272
00:18:13,950 --> 00:18:17,520
It's Thanksgiving, for Pete's sakes! A day of forgiveness.
今天是感恩節，是原諒之日！

273
00:18:17,690 --> 00:18:21,720
-It's a day to be thankful. -Don't make me come up there!
-是感謝之日吧…… -別和我唱反調！

274
00:18:21,900 --> 00:18:23,490
It's too late for apologies.
現在道歉太晚了！

275
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:26,460
Fine, let's just go. I don't need your stupid dinner.
好吧，我們走，我們可以不在這裡吃飯！

276
00:18:26,630 --> 00:18:29,570
That would be a lot more convincing if you weren't drooling.
如果你們開玩笑的話，可能更可信點。

277
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:33,270
-Oh, is that what that is? -Sorry.
-哦，我們現在就不是麼？ -對不起

278
00:18:34,540 --> 00:18:37,270
Come on, you guys, let's just do our own Thanksgiving.
夥計們，我們自己準備感恩節晚餐吧！

279
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:40,570
-Yeah, I'll cook. -Yeah, let's go out.
-好，我做飯！ -好，走吧！

280
00:18:42,150 --> 00:18:45,080
Yeah, you three have a nice Thanksgiving.
你們三個，感恩節快樂！

281
00:18:45,250 --> 00:18:48,620
-The three of us? -Yeah. You, Chan and the vein.
-三個？ -你，錢德，還有「白忙活」！

282
00:19:00,300 --> 00:19:02,630
-I'm stuck. -Joey, that is not gonna work.
-啊，我被卡住了！ -喬伊，少來！

283
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:04,830
No, seriously.
不，我是認真的

284
00:19:05,010 --> 00:19:07,500
-I'm really wedged in here. -I'll pull you through.
-我真的被卡住了 -我把你拖過來

285
00:19:07,670 --> 00:19:08,730
Okay.
好。

286
00:19:09,410 --> 00:19:11,970
Stop, stop, I'm worried about damaging my head.
啊，住手，住手 我擔心會弄傷我的頭！

287
00:19:12,150 --> 00:19:14,510
It's a little late for that.
已經晚了

288
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:17,140
Hurry up, you gotta do something.
快點，幫幫忙啊！

289
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:19,720
All right, well, this does not change anything.
這不會改變什麼的！

290
00:19:19,890 --> 00:19:22,010
We need to get something to grease his face.
我們需要點能增大空隙的工具。

291
00:19:22,190 --> 00:19:24,280
-We got turkey grease. -Bring it.
-我們有火雞汁！ -拿來。

292
00:19:24,460 --> 00:19:28,550
I just want to say that I'm sorry I referred to the vein as a separate person.
我很抱歉，我把「白忙活」算作一個人

293
00:19:29,130 --> 00:19:30,990
Here you go.
拿來了。

294
00:19:31,930 --> 00:19:34,370
Oh, that smells good.
啊，味道不錯

295
00:19:41,980 --> 00:19:44,770
-Okay? -Okay, try it.
-好了嗎？ -好，試試看。

296
00:19:46,580 --> 00:19:48,610
It isn't working.
沒用！

297
00:19:48,780 --> 00:19:52,310
-We're gonna have to unscrew the chain. -Hurry, I can't feel my ears.
-把鏈條卸下來吧。 -快點，我都感覺不到我的耳朵了！

298
00:19:52,490 --> 00:19:54,890
Can you ever feel your ears?
你曾經感覺到過耳朵麼？

299
00:19:55,060 --> 00:19:57,290
Interesting.
嗯，很有趣。

300
00:19:57,760 --> 00:20:01,750
-Chandler, where are your tools? -Oh, I left them on my bulldozer.
-錢德，你的工具哪裡去了？ -啊，我把它們放在別的地方了。

301
00:20:04,970 --> 00:20:07,090
I don't have tools.
我沒有工具。

302
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:10,730
-Well, I do, but Rachel borrowed them. -I lent them to Ross.
-我有，但被瑞秋借去了。 -我借給了羅斯。

303
00:20:10,900 --> 00:20:14,310
-I gave them to Joey. -I left them at the park.
-我給了喬伊。 -我留在車庫了。

304
00:20:16,380 --> 00:20:18,810
I'm finding it really hard not to mess with him.
這還真麻煩。

305
00:20:18,980 --> 00:20:21,140
I stuffed Brussels sprouts down his pants.
我早就已經被他褲子裡的甘藍菜味道弄暈了。

306
00:20:21,320 --> 00:20:22,340
Nice.
很好。

307
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:25,480
Okay, I have to get that.
好，我去接電話

308
00:20:25,650 --> 00:20:28,880
Now, when I get back, I want you and your friends to be gone.
當我回來的時候 我希望你和你的朋友們已經離開了。

309
00:20:29,060 --> 00:20:33,390
Thanksgiving is over. The vein has spoken.
感恩節完了！這是「白忙活」說的！

310
00:20:34,390 --> 00:20:38,730
-It's really starting to hurt. -Look, I'm gonna pull on the door..
-我的頭真的被卡住了！ -好吧，我會拉門

311
00:20:38,900 --> 00:20:42,930
and you guys push. Maybe we can get enough room to wiggle him out, okay?
然後你們努力推 這樣他就有足夠的空隙出來了，好吧？

312
00:20:43,100 --> 00:20:44,800
Okay, so push.
好，推吧！

313
00:20:44,970 --> 00:20:48,340
Just a sec. We're kind of in the middle of something here.
啊，等下，我們正忙著……

314
00:20:48,510 --> 00:20:51,440
Hey, stop putting things down my pants.
別往我的褲子裡面放東西！

315
00:20:51,610 --> 00:20:54,550
-Come on, guys, push! -Yeah, come on, push!
-來吧，夥計們，推吧！ -來，推，推，推！

316
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:56,910
Push! Push!
推，推！

317
00:21:06,460 --> 00:21:11,960
-My cranberries! -Man, I got food all over me.
-我的酸梅！ -我全身都是！

318
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:16,630
I can't believe what you did. Monica's gonna kill you.
慘不忍睹，莫尼卡會殺了你的！

319
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:21,460
Look! Look! Look what the.. Look what the floating heads did!
看，看，看 這個「漂腦袋」作了什麼？

320
00:21:23,340 --> 00:21:24,970
I don't care.
沒關係。

321
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:29,310
What's going on?
怎麼了？

322
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:31,580
That was the adoption agency.
是領養管理處打來的。

323
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:34,180
And?
然後？

324
00:21:34,350 --> 00:21:38,480
-We're getting a baby! -Are you serious?!
-我們可以領養孩子了！ -真的麼？	

325
00:21:44,230 --> 00:21:47,390
There's a pregnant woman in Ohio, and she picked us.
有個俄亥俄州的孕婦選了我們！

326
00:21:47,570 --> 00:21:50,830
-Oh, my God, that's great! -That's incredible.
-恭喜！真為你們高興！ -太好了！

327
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:55,230
I'm so happy for you.
恭喜你們！

328
00:21:56,010 --> 00:21:59,780
This Thanksgiving kicks last Thanksgiving's ass!
今年的感恩節比去年好太多了！

329
00:22:06,420 --> 00:22:10,880
To Monica and Chandler and that knocked-up girl in Ohio.
敬莫尼卡和錢德 還有那俄亥俄州的小傢伙！

330
00:22:15,860 --> 00:22:18,920
I'm just so happy you guys are finally getting a kid.
你們兩個終於有孩子了，這真讓我高興。

331
00:22:19,970 --> 00:22:23,420
I know. Have you considered pageanting?
你們沒考慮過懷孕麼？

332
00:22:25,070 --> 00:22:30,070
I can't believe they called. I mean, we're actually getting a baby.
他們打來電話，我們就會有孩子了 這真是不可思議！

333
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:32,110
I know how you feel.
我能體會你們的感受。

334
00:22:34,150 --> 00:22:35,640
-Really? -Sure.
-真的麼？ -當然啦

335
00:22:35,820 --> 00:22:38,940
I went through the exact same thing with Alicia May Emory.
我以前經歷過完全相同的事情。

336
00:22:41,860 --> 00:22:44,050
The waiting, the wondering.
那種期待，那種迷茫

337
00:22:44,220 --> 00:22:48,660
Then one day, I get that call from Toys "R" Us.
直到有一天 我從托伊那家店買到了那車！

338
00:22:48,830 --> 00:22:51,760
She was in stock.
她又有貨了！

339
00:22:52,470 --> 00:22:55,160
That is the exact same thing.
確實「完全相同」。

340
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


341
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


